A||N||5||85GTgreasmnky||Tapping or Knocking coming from Fuel Rail Area???||||1||
Z||000000||85GTgreasmnky||10-13-2001||11:45 AM||||I have just installed a 2.8L long block with a moderate cam and heads ported and polished into my 85 GT.  After cranking up, I hear a tapping or slight knocking sound coming from the top portion of the engine at the fuel rail/injector area.  I have adjusted the valve lash 3 separate times to ensure it is not from a lifter.  I have checked the exhaust manifolds for any slight cracks or leaks.  I still am at a loss as to the noise.  It is loudest at the fuel rail.  Can injectors or any part of the fuel rail make a tapping/knocking noise??  Any suggestions.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Seanh||10-13-2001||12:10 PM||||Its just the injectors fireing. Mine are loud too. ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Bluebottlejunky||10-13-2001||12:47 PM||||Yup, I just replaced mine..and mine are like that too..if I listen right above the Fiero sticker on the plenum, its pretty loud, or when im drivin around. Im pretty sure it wasn't lifters because..it didnt make the noise untill I changed the Injectors..<P>------------------<BR>Mike<BR>85'GT 4sp<BR>AIM: <B>KilleRedGT</B>||||reg||1
Z||000003||crgkstnr||10-13-2001||01:00 PM||||oops, I see you already checked for exhaust leaks.<P><p>[This message has been edited by crgkstnr (edited 10-13-2001).]||||reg||7
Z||000004||SLYGUY||10-13-2001||02:07 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 85GTgreasmnky:<BR><B>I have just installed a 2.8L long block with a moderate cam and heads ported and polished into my 85 GT.  After cranking up, I hear a tapping or slight knocking sound coming from the top portion of the engine at the fuel rail/injector area.  I have adjusted the valve lash 3 separate times to ensure it is not from a lifter.  I have checked the exhaust manifolds for any slight cracks or leaks.  I still am at a loss as to the noise.  It is loudest at the fuel rail.  Can injectors or any part of the fuel rail make a tapping/knocking noise??  Any suggestions.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>My 88GT has the exact same noise from the exact same area. It doesn't sound mechanical, rather electrical like a relay switching off and on very quickly. <BR>It isn't directly rpm related either. <BR>I figured it was fuel system related. Glad to hear that it is. I'll keep a close 'ear on it though!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Sly<P>||||reg||1
Z||000005||85GTgreasmnky||10-15-2001||10:51 AM||||The knocking sounds like a bad lifter, I've just torn down the top have of the engine again and checked all of the lifters, rods, and rocker arms.  All look good. The tapping/knocking is really louder than an injector noise - Unless one of the injectors is really acting up.  Is it possible one of the cam lobes could be hitting something?  It is a steady constant knocking that increases with RPM's.||||reg||1
